        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Prepare Confirmed Record').item.json.name }},\n\nYour appointment has been confirmed.\n\nService: {{ $('Prepare Confirmed Record').item.json.service }}\nDate: {{ $('Prepare Confirmed Record').item.json.date }}\nTime: {{ $('Prepare Confirmed Record').item.json.time }} (Africa/Cairo)\nAppointment ID: {{ $('Prepare Confirmed Record').item.json.appointment_id }}\n\nIf you need to reschedule or cancel, please contact the clinic at least 24 hours in advance.\n\nDental Clinic Team",
